\"","specTableContent_left":" Specifications: Category Proliant Server Sub-Category BL20 Generation G2 Part Number 300876-B21 Products ID 6181 Form Factor Blade Processor Type Xeon 2.8 GHz Processors Qty 1 Installed Memory 512 MB Platform PC Bus Speed 400 MHz Maximum RAM 4 GB RAID Support RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 10, RAID 5 Networking Type Network Adapter Data Link Protocol Ethernet, Fast Ethernet, Gigabit Etherne","id_right":7518908,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":14269885,"brand_right":"\"HP Enterprise\"","title_right":" \"300876-B21 BL20P G2 Xeon 2.8GHz 512 1P\" \"Null\"","description_right":" \"Description: BL20PG2 Xeon 2.8GHz 512 1P Blade Manufacturer Part# 300876-B21\"","price_right":"\"USD\", \"$661.55\"","specTableContent_right":" Specifications: Category Proliant Server Sub-Category Blade Generation BL20 Part Number 300876-B21 Products ID 15409 Form Factor Blade Processor Type Xeon 2.8 GHz Processors Qty 1 Installed Memory 512 MB Platform PC Bus Speed 400 MHz Maximum RAM 4 GB RAID Support RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 10, RAID 5 Networking Type Network Adapter Data Link Protocol Ethernet, Fast Ethernet, Gigabit Etherne"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":31,"row":{"pair_id":"2812#3788402","label":0,"id_left":2812,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":204205,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"HyperX FURY - DDR4 4 GB DIMM 288-pin\" \" HyperX 288-pin HX426C15FB/4 System Memory (RAM) CDWG.com","description_left":"\"Plug and Play for high performance with Intel's 100 Series and X99 chipsets.HyperX FURY DDR4 memory automatically overclocks to the highest frequency published, up to 2666 MHz, to deliver instant top-level performance for motherboards with Intel's 100 Series and X99 chipsets.It's a small investment for premium components that complement Intel's 2, 4, 6 and 8-core processors for faster video editing, 3D rendering, gaming and AI processing.Its stylish low-profile heat spreader with signature FURY design lets you show off your rig in style.\" ","price_left":"\"$\", \"49.87\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3788402,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":144291,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"HyperX FURY - DDR4 16 GB DIMM 288-pin\" \" HyperX 288-pin HX424C15FB/16 System Memory (RAM) CDW.com","description_right":"\"HyperX FURY DDR4 automatically recognizes the platform it's plugged into and automatically overclocks to the high frequency for hassle-free, plug-and-play functionality. HyperX FURY DDR4 is a minimal investment in premium components that results in faster speeds, higher performance and enhanced reliability - plus it looks really cool. It stays cool, too, thanks to low power consumption resulting in less heat, with a lower voltage specification than DDR3. Its stylish, low-profile design complements the look of the PC hardware while helping you stand out from the crowd of squared designs.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":32,"row":{"pair_id":"928926#7273158","label":0,"id_left":928926,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":4703255,"brand_left":"\"HP Enterprise\"","title_left":" \"533995-B22 HP Xeon X3220 2.4GHz DL120 G5\" \"Null\"","description_left":" \"Description:Intelï¿½ Xeonï¿½ Processor X3220 DL120 G5(2.40GHz/4-core/8MB/95W)Full Option KitPart Number(s)Manufacturer Part# 533995-B22\"","price_left":"\"CAD\", \"$2,984.74 CAD\"","specTableContent_left":" Specifications: Category Proliant Processor Sub-Category Intel Xeon Generation G5 Part Number 533995-B22 Products ID 458226 Product Type Processor Processor Type Intel Xeon Processor Core Quad-Core Processor Qty 1 Clock Speed 2.40GHz Bus Speed 1066MHz L2 Cache 8MB 64-bit Processing Yes Process Technology 65nm Processor Socket Socket LGA-775 Thermal Design Power 105W","id_right":7273158,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":4661188,"brand_right":"\"HP Enterprise\"","title_right":" \"533993-B22 HP Xeon E7400 2.8GHz DL120 G5\" \"Null\"","description_right":" \"Description:Intelï¿½ Xeonï¿½ E7400 DL120 G5(2.80GHz/2-core/3MB/65W)Full Processor Option KitPart Number(s) Manufacturer Part# 533993-B22\"","price_right":"\"USD\", \"$2,995.95\"","specTableContent_right":" Specifications: Category Proliant Processor Sub-Category Intel Xeon Generation G5 Part Number 533993-B22 Products ID 458231 Product Type Processor Processor Type Intel Xeon Processor Core Dual-Core Processor Qty 1 Clock Speed 2.80GHz QuickPath Interconnect 1066MHz L2 Cache 3MB 64-bit Processing Yes Process Technology 45nm Processor Socket Socket LGA-775 Thermal Design Power 65W"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":33,"row":{"pair_id":"7703549#12245424","label":1,"id_left":7703549,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":346090,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Apple 12.9\" iPad Pro Smart cover MK0L2M/A\"@en MK0L2M/A LN72920 - MK0L2ZM/A | SCAN UK\"@en","description_left":"\"12.9\" Apple Smart Cover for iPad Pro, Charcoal Grey       \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12245424,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":346090,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Apple Smart screen cover for tablet\" \" Apple tablet - MK0L2ZM/A Tablet Cases & Covers CDWG.com","description_right":"\"iPad and the iPad Smart Cover are made for each other. Literally. The iPad Smart Cover has been designed to work side-by-side with iPad - and on top and underneath it, too. Smart magnetic technology built into each really pulls them together. The iPad Smart Cover falls perfectly into place and stays put to protect your iPad screen, yet doesn't add bulk to its thin, light design. Open the Smart Cover and your iPad wakes up instantly. Close it and your iPad goes to sleep automatically. And here's another smart part: it transforms into the perfect movie-watching, game-playing, web-surfing stand. Your iPad will be smart all around with the iPad Smart Cover!\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":34,"row":{"pair_id":"2365521#6800998","label":1,"id_left":2365521,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":662806,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"AMD Ryzen Threadripper 1950X Box\"@es","description_left":"\"Procesador CPU 16C/32T unlocked, Auto-OC, 3.4/4.0Ghz, Zen Summit Ridge 14nM, Socket TR4, RAM Quad DDR4, 8MB L2+32MB L3 cache, 180W, 60X PCIe\"@es ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6800998,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":662806,"brand_right":"\"AMD\"@en","title_right":" \"AMD Ryzen Threadripper Sixteen Core 1950X 4.00GHz (Socket TR4) Processor - Retail\"@en \"▷ AMD TR… | OcUK\"@en","description_right":"\"YD195XA8AEWOF, 16 Core with 32 Threads, 4.00GHz clock speed, 14nm FinFet Process, 40MB L3 Cache, Quad Channel DDR4 Controller, 3 Year Warranty\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":35,"row":{"pair_id":"15808194#11347714","label":0,"id_left":15808194,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":914299,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"HPE Smart Array P421/2GB with FBWC - storage controller (RAID) SATA 6Gb/s\" \" HPE 6Gb/s 631674-B21 RAID Controllers CDW.com","description_left":"\"The HPE Smart Array P421 Controller is a low profile, 6 Gb/s, PCIe 3.0, Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) RAID controller that provides enterprise class, storage performance, maximum external scalability, and data protection for select HP ProLiant Gen8 rack and tower servers. It features eight external SAS ports and delivers increased server uptime by providing advanced storage functionality, including online RAID level migration (between any RAID levels) with flash back write cache, global online spare, and pre-failure warning. Data Compatibility among all models of Smart Array controllers allows simple and easy migration at any time when needs for higher performance, capacity, and availability increase. Even new generations of Smart Array controllers can understand the data format of previous generations of Smart Array controllers.\" ","price_left":"\"$\", \"733.99\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11347714,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":387759,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Transcend TS64GUSDU1 - flash memory card 64 GB SDXC UHS-I\" \" Transcend UHS-I Flash Memory Cards CDW.com","description_right":"\"Combining next-generation Ultra High Speed Class 1 technology with extra large capacity, Transcend microSDXC UHS-I memory cards not only provide the best possible performance during a host of mobile activities but also enough storage space to carry an entire collection of personal media files.Today's advanced smartphones and tablets are fast and powerful, with memory- hungry apps and full-HD recording capabilities that perform best with high-speed, high-capacity storage media. Offering vast storage space and superior read/write speeds, Transcend's micro SDHC card is the perfect memory upgrade solution to keep pace with your mobile lifestyle.\" ","price_right":"\"$\", \"31.99\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":36,"row":{"pair_id":"6179192#1546919","label":0,"id_left":6179192,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":658371,"brand_left":"\"Corsair\"@en","title_left":" \"Corsair Dominator Platinum 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 PC4-24000 3000MHz Dual Channel Kit \"@en 2x8GB | CMD16GX4M2B3000C15 Novatech\"@en","description_left":"\"DDR4, 3000MHz, CL15, 1.35v, XMP 2.0, Corsair Link Enabled, Lifetime Warranty\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Memory Type DDR4 (PC4-24000) Capacity 16GB (2 x 8GB) Tested Speed 3000 MHz Tested Latency 15-17-17-35 Tested Voltage 1.35V Registered / Unbuffered Unbuffered Error Checking Non-ECC Memory Features XMP 2.0, Dominator Platinum Heatsink, Corsair Link Compatible","id_right":1