tão SD. Você será capaz de usar o seu cartão de memória com câmeras SD habilitado, filmadoras, tablets e laptops.Especificações:Fator de forma: microSDHC (16GB, 32GB), microSDXC (64GB)As capacidades disponíveis: 16GB, 32GB, 64GBPerformance / velocidade: até 60MB / s de leitura e até a velocidade de 40MB / s para gravaçãoProva de temperatura, à prova d'água, à prova de choque e à prova de raio xDimensão do cartão: 0.59in 0.43in x x .04in (14,99 milímetros x 10,92 milímetros x 1,02 milímetros)Temperatura de operação: 13F para 185F (25C a 85 C)Temperatura de armazenamento: 40F para 185F (40C a 85C)Compatibilidade: Compatível com todos os microSDHC, microSDXC, microSDHC UHS I, e microSDXC UHS eu apoio dispositivos hostClasse 10 e UHS Speed ??Class 3 (U3) para 4K Ultra HD e vídeo Full HDRescuePro luxo de recuperação de dados para download de software oferta\n\t\t\tTem interesse em Sandisk Extreme microSDHC 64Gb Type 10? Neste momento o produto encontra-se disponível na swiminn, a sua loja online de . Na swiminn poderá encontrar mais produtos de  da marca Sandisk. Não espere mais e desfrute de Sandisk Extreme microSDHC 64Gb Type 10 em apenas alguns cliques. Descubra a vasta gama de acessórios de  da swiminn.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tClique no link seguinte para obter mais informações sobre:\n\t\t\t\t\tEspecificações \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tClique no link seguinte para obter mais informações sobre:\n\t\t\t\t\tManual\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tGuia de tamanhos\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":45,"row":{"pair_id":"1616098#15957918","label":0,"id_left":1616098,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":30222,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Ballistix Sport - DDR4 8 GB DIMM 288-pin\" \" Ballistix 288-pin BLS8G4D240FSA System Memory (RAM) CDW.com","description_left":"\"Speed. Style. Sport. Get more out of your memory. Designed for performance enthusiasts and anyone who simply wants to get more out of their system, Ballistix Sport memory helps you do just that. Compared to standard PC memory, Ballistix Sport delivers faster speeds, lower latencies, and increased bandwidth for affordable and seamless performance. With easy plug-and-play installation, certified Intel XMP profiles for easy configuration, and an integrated heat spreader to control memory temperatures, Ballistix Sport delivers more. Give your processor the resources it needs to win, and make your computer faster and more responsive.BLS8G4D240FSA is a 8GB DDR4 desktop module that operates at speeds up to 2400 MT/s and has a CL16 latency. It is an Unbuffered DIMM. It conforms to the industry standard DDR4 UDIMM layout of 288 pins and is compatible with systems that take DDR4 2400MT/s UDIMM memory.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15957918,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":148547,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Intel Solid-State Drive DC S3610 Series - solid state drive 800 GB SATA\" \" Intel SATA SSDSC2BX800G401 Solid State Drives (SSDs) CDW.com","description_right":"\"The Intel SSD DC S3610 Series offers advanced data center SSDs optimized for mixed read-write performance, endurance and strong data protection.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":46,"row":{"pair_id":"1616098#90217","label":0,"id_left":1616098,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":30222,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Ballistix Sport - DDR4 8 GB DIMM 288-pin\" \" Ballistix 288-pin BLS8G4D240FSA System Memory (RAM) CDW.com","description_left":"\"Speed. Style. Sport. Get more out of your memory. Designed for performance enthusiasts and anyone who simply wants to get more out of their system, Ballistix Sport memory helps you do just that. Compared to standard PC memory, Ballistix Sport delivers faster speeds, lower latencies, and increased bandwidth for affordable and seamless performance. With easy plug-and-play installation, certified Intel XMP profiles for easy configuration, and an integrated heat spreader to control memory temperatures, Ballistix Sport delivers more. Give your processor the resources it needs to win, and make your computer faster and more responsive.BLS8G4D240FSA is a 8GB DDR4 desktop module that operates at speeds up to 2400 MT/s and has a CL16 latency. It is an Unbuffered DIMM. It conforms to the industry standard DDR4 UDIMM layout of 288 pins and is compatible with systems that take DDR4 2400MT/s UDIMM memory.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":90217,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":1561792,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Samsung - DDR4 8 GB DIMM 288-pin\" \" Samsung 288-pin M393A1G40DB0-CPB System Memory (RAM) CDW.com","description_right":"\"Samsung DDR4 is an optimized solution for highly virtualized environments, high-performance computing and networking.Achieving bandwidth speeds up to 3.2Gbps, Samsung DDR4 delivers higher performance at a higher speed than both DDR2 and DDR3. Compared to DDR3L (low power DDR3), Samsung DDR4 shows an overall improvement in performance in every DIMM and a performance that is more than 40 percent better at 1 DIMM per channel.A major decrease in voltage and the improved I/O power efficiency of DDR4 synchronous dynamic RAM (SDRAM) translates into significant cost savings. According to Samsung internal testing, DDR4 boasts a continuous working voltage of 1.2 V, a voltage that is 11 percent lower than the 1.35 V consumed by DDR3L. By adopting POD (Pseudo Open Drain) for data transmission, Samsung DDR4's input/output (I/O) power consumption is reduced by 50 percent compared to the previously-used SSTL (Stub Series Terminated Logic) of DDR3L. Overall, Samsung DDR4 shows a Performance/watt level more than 20 percent higher than DDR3L.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":47,"row":{"pair_id":"7703549#8899643","label":0,"id_left":7703549,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":346090,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Apple 12.9\" iPad Pro Smart cover MK0L2M/A\"@en MK0L2M/A LN72920 - MK0L2ZM/A | SCAN UK\"@en","description_left":"\"12.9\" Apple Smart Cover for iPad Pro, Charcoal Grey       \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8899643,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":1138610,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Apple iPad mini 4 Wi-Fi 128GB - Oro\"@es Mini Gris Black Friday 2017 \"@es","description_right":"\"Null\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":48,"row":{"pair_id":"1394968#2442916","label":0,"id_left":1394968,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":331504,"brand_left":"\"WD\"@en","title_left":" \"WD Red 1TB 5400rpm SATA 6Gb/s 64MB Cache HDD OEM (WD10EFRX)\"@en \"▷ WD (WD10EFRX) | OcUK\"@en","description_left":"\"1TB Capacity, 3.5 inch, SATA 6GB/s Interface, Optimal compatibility for NAS systems,  3 Year Warranty\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2442916,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":190024,"brand_right":"\"WD\"@en","title_right":" \"WD Red Pro 4TB 7200rpm SATA 6Gb/s 128MB Cache HDD OEM (WD4002FFWX)\"@en \"▷ WD (WD400… | OcUK\"@en","description_right":"\"4TB Capacity, 3.5 inch, SATA 6GB/s Interface, IntellliPower 7200RPM Spin Speed, 128MB Cache, 5 Year Warranty\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":49,"row":{"pair_id":"1696869#1615109","label":0,"id_left":1696869,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":5432,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Gigabyte Intel Z370M D3H Coffee Lake Micro ATX Motherboard\"@en Motherboa